==Restrictions==
Cat Deploy Cost: Only 1,200¢ or less

==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Croco]]s spawn after 0.67 seconds<sup>20f</sup>, delay 5.33~10.67 seconds<sup>160f~320f</sup>.
*8 [[Gory|Gories]] spawn after 5.33 seconds<sup>160f</sup>, delay 16~24 seconds<sup>480f~720f</sup>.
*3 [[Croco]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 19.33~20 seconds<sup>580f~600f</sup>.
*3 [[Croco]]s spawn after 17.33 seconds<sup>520f</sup>, delay 19.33~20 seconds<sup>580f~600f</sup>.
*3 [[Croco]]s spawn after 19.33 seconds<sup>580f</sup>, delay 19.33~20 seconds<sup>580f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Cerberus Kids]] spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 10~20 seconds<sup>300f~600f</sup>.
*2 [[Cerberus Kids]] spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 29.33~30 seconds<sup>880f~900f</sup>.
*2 [[Cerberus Kids]] spawn after 30.67 seconds<sup>920f</sup>, delay 29.33~30 seconds<sup>880f~900f</sup>.
*2 [[Cerberus Kids]] spawn after 32.67 seconds<sup>980f</sup>, delay 29.33~30 seconds<sup>880f~900f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[King's Mimic]] spawns as the boss.
**6 [[Aku Doge]]s spawn after 5 seconds<sup>150f</sup>, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
**4 [[Aku Doge]]s spawn, delay 23.33~26.67 seconds<sup>700f~800f</sup>.
**3 [[Aku Gory|Aku Gories]] spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 20~23.33 seconds<sup>600f~700f</sup>.
**2 [[Aku Gory|Aku Gories]] spawn, delay 36.67~40 seconds<sup>1,100f~1,200f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Simply bring 3-4 meatshields and generalist units like [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Can Can Cat]], [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Paris Cat]], and other units that safely outrange the Aku Gories. Also, bring [[Swimmer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Fishman Cat]] for King's Mimic. If you're worrying about the Aku Doges' shields, you can bring Shield Piercers like [[Aku Researcher (Rare Cat)|Evil Aku Researcher]] or [[Talents|talented]] [[Li'l Gross Cat (Special Cat)|Li'l Macho Legs Cat]].

